really work; I know many people in Lexington who base the site of
their home on the "good schools."  In fact, I knew a few families
who moved 3 times -- to get residency for the "good" grade school,
a "good" middle school, and the "good" high school.  None of these
moved were longer than 1.5 miles; that's ridiculous.  

