This professor's advocations seem to be related to what the
legal system should provide in the way of compensation to
victims of rape. I think these views _do_ belong to the
realm of politics and therefore, are political views. I
can accept that these views can be seen as so profoundly
appalling, disgusting... even frightening, that one might
miss the political side of thier nature. Never-the-less,
I personally see them as political views.

